:"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；降维限制见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9964b0194f4fb6e6\" href=\"?note=9964b0194f4fb6e6\" title=\"27-df-restrict\">27-df-restrict</a>，异或见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\partial_i f\\coloneqq f_{i\\leftarrow0}\\oplus f_{i\\leftarrow1}\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_{n-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\partial_i f\\coloneqq f_{i\\leftarrow0}\\oplus f_{i\\leftarrow1}\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_{n-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定第 i 位后的两个 (n−1) 元函数在相同剩余坐标上求异或。用限制的降维语义避免自由坐标不一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-restrict","status":"resolved","id":"9964b0194f4fb6e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-restrict]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-restrict","status":"resolved","id":"9964b0194f4fb6e6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N^+$，$i\\in[n]$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；降维限制见 [[27-df-restrict]]，异或见 [[27-df-boolop]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N^+$，$i\\in[n]$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；降维限制见 [[27-df-restrict]]，异或见 [[27-df-boolop]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N^+","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial_i f\\coloneqq f_{i\\leftarrow0}\\oplus f_{i\\leftarrow1}\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_{n-1}.","display":true}],"bytes":1093,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-boolderivative|df-boolderivative — Boolean derivative]]"},{"id":"4bf511a4d3b45272","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N^+$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$i\\in[n]$；见 [[27-df-boolderivative]]、[[27-df-essvar]]、[[27-df-constfunc]]。"}],"outgoing":["9964b0194f4fb6e6","11de8465f2282555"]}